id: pm-swarm-portable-recovery
title: Recover abandoned operation pins without Linux locality probes
description: "Operation pins intentionally remain potentially live when host-boot and PID-namespace locality cannot be established. On platforms without those probes an interrupted owner can require operator cleanup after the bounded swarm_busy wait. Design and certify portable owner identity and liveness without allowing cross-host, cross-boot or cross-namespace PID confusion; retain the current fail-closed foreign and legacy owner regressions."
